### Apply to job 2 -> saves applicationId2
POST http://localhost:8083/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "{{jobId2}}",
  "coverLetter": "Trying frontend too."
}

> {% client.global.set("applicationId2", response.body.id); %}

### Employer tries to withdraw -> 403
DELETE http://localhost:8083/applications/{{applicationId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employerToken}}

### Candidate withdraws -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8083/applications/{{applicationId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### Already-reviewed application -> 400
DELETE http://localhost:8083/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}